  <item>
    <title>Vol.24 世界读书日特辑：音乐和文学，一个都不能少。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e8dad71e94ae6921e8d264</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e8dad71e94ae6921e8d264</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 14:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>音乐和文学，不用的表达方式，却时常产生奇妙的共振。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你有没有过这样的体验：听到某首歌的时候，脑海里会不自觉浮现一本书里的故事？或者反过来，读某本小说的时候，突然觉得似曾相识像极了某段旋律。这不是错觉。事实上，很多我们热爱的摇滚乐队和独立音乐人，他们本身就是狂热的读者。而很多我们耳熟能详的作家，也经常把从音乐中感受到的氛围写进书中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这集节目里我会分享10首歌，对应10部文学作品，简单聊聊之间的渊源。</span></p><span></span><p><span>☁️ 更多与文学碰撞的好音乐：网易云歌单 → </span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=8394394104&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19tT0NfXEqTZxUSpY/5jXag6S73oBndspA=" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=8394394104&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19tT0NfXEqTZxUSpY/5jXag6S73oBndspA="><span>音乐和文学，一个都不能少</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🙋🏻‍♀️ 欢迎在评论区，分享你喜欢的和文学作品相关的音乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐和文学，一个都不能少。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4·23世界读书日，祝你阅读和听歌都愉快✌🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵张玮玮 - 索拉里斯星</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚斯坦尼斯瓦夫·莱姆《索拉里斯星》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵生祥乐队 - 江湖卡夫卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚卡夫卡《变形记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵尧十三 - 雨霖铃</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚柳永《雨霖铃·寒蝉凄切》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵王菲 - 百年孤寂</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚加西亚·马尔克斯《百年孤独》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵宝石Gem - 海子</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚海子《海子诗集》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Jasing Rye - Baoyu（宝玉）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚曹雪芹《红楼梦》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Muse - Resistance</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚乔治·奥威尔《1984》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 涉及到的书📚：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿道司·赫胥黎《美丽新世界》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>乔治·奥威尔《1984》《动物农场》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>J.D. 塞林格《麦田里的守望者》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>杰克·凯鲁亚克《在路上》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Kings of Convenience - Brave New World</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3066">51:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Blur - Tender</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚弗朗西斯·司各特·菲兹杰拉德《夜色温柔》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Kate Bush - Wuthering Heights</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚艾米莉·勃朗特《呼啸山庄》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
