  <item>
    <title>Vol.23 马年听马专，嘚嘚嘚嘚驾！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69876b23a22480add6048090</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69876b23a22480add6048090</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Feb 2026 19:20:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有一种说法是立春之后就是新年。如果按这种计算方式现在已经进入了丙午马年，也是我的本命年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>某个听歌夜晚，灵机一动：整理了一批以“马”为主题的专辑，制作成了这期节目。音乐带我回到了记忆深处，也鼓励我对生活抱有更多期待。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*因为是一集以音乐分享为主的内容，且大多为器乐专辑，所以本集节目中每支音乐都会保留完整版本。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>希望无论你处于什么样的环境，都能看到突破的可能性。像一匹马，自由不羁、洒脱自在。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> toe - everything means nothing</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuW9WV_VPIKVBRFW9jflOXVRVO0c.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 惘闻 - welcome to utopia</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjuU6uj74PfwHpvkCU_1kjUclmQX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> Eddie Rayner - Sacre Bleu</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmX6Anewx_kgO2f2DsX0xPY3in_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> Dirty Three - Horse stories</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FteKHEBeTzYVdMN9rdzLe5ciQHur.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 法兹乐队 FAZI - 谁会做奔跑的马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnayV7f_7Kh7QQy92LWf2eYqgU3l.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> Motorama - Horse</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7zVu6EIjA7dVSwSBrrInwg1T0D.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> Patti Smith - LandHorses &nbsp;Land of a Thousand Dances &nbsp;La Mer(de)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fowab_JqcrwBcnRnUSBjdEtU7IiD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵 网易云歌单直达：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=17739141269&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19xwOUUFsGAC6qnx3kd80LjkY5lVrBG/XU=" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=17739141269&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19xwOUUFsGAC6qnx3kd80LjkY5lVrBG/XU="><span>马年听马专，嘚嘚嘚嘚驾！</span></a></p>]]></description>
