    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 09:23:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>明天要去上班了，今天就是2025年可供自己支配的最后一天了，某天凌晨4点听了小璐的25年回顾，每个月都条理清晰，歌曲选择也格外贴切，录音语速均匀游刃有余。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提问：从心底升起一股由衷的敬意，是什么成语？？?</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期歌单</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>波兰火车 &nbsp;鲸鱼马戏团</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Boreal Forest &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Mammal Hands</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Chacun Pour Soi &nbsp;&nbsp;Paradis</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Zurkhen Helbert Boroo &nbsp;&nbsp;The GALTMAH</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dreames &nbsp;&nbsp;大橋トリオ</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>燕子 &nbsp;疆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>owai，owai 陈抒妮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>太阳光明照我心 文兆杰</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>暗舞 陈小霞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Verd Mín &nbsp;Eivør</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>提前祝大家元旦快乐~！</span></p>]]></description>
