  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 2025年过去了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693d75598231c0aa585b8ed5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693d75598231c0aa585b8ed5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 14:25:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是什么时候意识到：2025年快要过完的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目里，我会按照每月一首歌的方式，推荐12首我喜欢的音乐。这些歌在歌名或歌词里都有与对应月份有关的内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你和我一起在音乐中回忆2025年：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>今年有没有尝试过一些以前没有做过的事情？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>今年让你感到幸福的瞬间是什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>去年陪伴在身边的人今年还在吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>年底的自己有没有和年初不一样？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>假如给明年年底的自己留一个问题会留什么呢？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 黄渤 - 过去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 岸田繁 - 1月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> シド - 2月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 窦唯 - 三月春天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> Patti Smith - April Fool</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 姜昕 - 五月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> Horsebeach - June</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 吴俊德 - 七月的天空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 任贤齐 - 我是一只鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 周云蓬 - 九月(海子)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 山下達郎 - MONDAY BLUE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">40:37</a> Guns N' Roses - November Rain</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> Club 8 - Love In December</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 听歌愉快，明年再见~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6477692689b7edd50548630f/lvNH6wmfLfTn3o17GyyLSpbiVJGo.m4a" length="52348862" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj-fWhgt6LD0ZatraKViYXyQtAOJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.20 中年人听五月天，生活没有暂停键</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e92eec224325ea7095b25d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e92eec224325ea7095b25d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 18:02:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见的歌不鸽！突然冒出来的小璐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次想分享的是五月天。起因是一位朋友前阵子去看了五月天演唱会，回来给我进行了360°无死角安利。虽说之前有些无感，但最近认认真真听了之后，忍不住感叹：我竟然在中年时才遇到这支宝藏乐队！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这集节目里你可能不会听到大合唱金曲，也可能不会听到青春励志热血满满的音乐。更多的是我比较偏个人喜好、觉得很有意思的歌，以及在听歌过程中收获的一些启发和感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Enrich Your Life(伴奏)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 入坑歌曲：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>志明与春娇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 简单直接又词穷的可爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 总想逃离地球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 无法逃离回归平凡的“中年感”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>任意门</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 平行世界的奇妙相交</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>不见不散</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> 致敬Beatles</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>约翰蓝侬</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 闽南语听不懂但好听！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>啾啾啾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 中年爱情太需要勇气了</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>我不愿让你一个人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 中年友情真是不容易啊</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>转眼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 对流行音乐的狭隘偏见</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>伤心的人别听慢歌</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 器乐演奏也好听</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>透露</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a> 偶然更新，有缘再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊🕊</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播/策划/后期/编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6477692689b7edd50548630f/lvpySvDr5YgV4YQnr2jQTlNbChK0.m4a" length="39815077" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnHo-V99_H7ebac1ueCzPXrDQm2Y.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol19.Low Roar的音乐世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686b9f1d60f8f77d4047487a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686b9f1d60f8f77d4047487a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 10:25:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>回伊犁快一个月了，租了房子，收拾妥当，终于在昨晚调试好设备，今天迫不及待的录完了这期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一共录了两遍，不算特别满意，但比第一遍好多了，歌曲也做了些调整。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是以电台直播的形式录制，写了一部分稿子，也即兴发挥了一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>说回Low Roar ，通关了死亡搁浅，在游戏里结合类似冰岛的环境，他们的音乐给我带来了很大的冲击，游戏结束每当不知道听什么的时候，就会打开他们的专辑，每张专辑都听了很多遍，前期作品听得更多一些，主唱去世后，制作人把之前的demo又拿出来做了最后一张专辑，就是我们本集的封面。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6477692689b7edd50548630f/ljEp7FOHOism4OTDzJ0mbV7_aqVo.m4a" length="81874514" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1zXFIgds6GP7qkNKEYIcqcA6SR.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.18 拜拜特辑：云峰离开大理了，这档播客要重启了 :)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6848fc8f1c45a63232981848</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6848fc8f1c45a63232981848</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 04:00:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如题。这是我和云峰在大理面对面录的最后一集播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他和敏君离开了大理，决定回新疆老家生活（本集封面就是他回家后发的第一条朋友圈）。告别的过程冗长又仓促，没搞那些煽情的套路，我也没有泪洒播客录制现场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开开心心挥别老朋友，迎接新开始，这其中也包括：歌不鸽这档节目要重新恢复更新啦！🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位听众朋友积极监督云峰自称的“定时更新”（狗头表情）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们聊了聊云峰在大理三年的生活感受，互相向对方提了几个问题。也分享了好听的和“再见”有关的歌~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 关于播客重启的打算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 云峰的大理生活：平静、焦灼、解脱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 告别的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 对新生活的期待就是期待本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 本期播客共三轮：互问对方一个问题 → 听歌 → 回答</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 小璐问云峰：最终如何下定决心要离开？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 说再见 - 本能實業</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 云峰问小璐：最近工作生活顺利吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 再·见 - 达达乐队</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 小璐问云峰：在大理有发生过什么“万万没想到”的事情吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 &nbsp;再度重相逢 - 伍佰</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 云峰问小璐：那你呢？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 再见，再见 - 逃跑计划</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 小璐问云峰：作为我从成都来到大理生活的完整见证人，你怎么看待我这几年的生活？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 再会吧！素兰 - OK男女合唱团</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 云峰问小璐：现在对你来说，最重要的是什么？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 &nbsp;Den sista sången - Kent</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3652">1:00:52</a> 我们什么时候会再见面呢？🎵 啊朋友再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 网易云歌单直达：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=13593888955&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/06cW1ELTh+dvJvban6B3dvEt5P1GkWh4=" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=13593888955&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/06cW1ELTh+dvJvban6B3dvEt5P1GkWh4="><span>拜拜咯</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-----------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小璐、云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
