  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 九月结束了，分享几件小事。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fac56f6c7f8177863a054e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fac56f6c7f8177863a054e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 15:36:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>9月份对于我和云峰来说，都是忙碌充实且情绪饱满的一个月，</span></p><span></span><p><span>如同在最后一天的夜晚一边在书店加班一边着急忙慌编辑shownotes的我，又被突然下起来的大雨拦截回不了家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很久没有在书店待到12点了，跨月了，哈哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集分享几件小事和最近听的歌，祝愿10月松弛愉悦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 云峰的第一件小事：雨天的车里听到嘟嘟嘟嘟</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 回归 - 黔东南侗族原住民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 小璐的第一件小事：书店一位rapper读者推荐了一首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 小路 - C-BLOCK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 云峰的第二件小事：每年中秋节就会想念奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 断魂汤 - 音速行星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 小璐的第二件小事：书店两周年，我尽力了</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 Did My Best - The Voidz</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 云峰的第三件小事：打算回新疆老家发展了</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 戈壁之旅 - 戈壁计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> 小璐的第三件小事：去了舟山Can Festival！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 Wake Me up When September Ends - Green Day</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 SEE YOU AGAIN - World's End Girlfriend</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> 云峰的第四件小事</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 Giorgio by Moroder - Daft Punk</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 网易云歌单直达：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12657673705&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12657673705&amp;userid=51289958"><span>嘟嘟嘟嘟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-----------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小璐、云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
