  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 好友歌单：在碉堡酒馆和小封一起听听歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d096f1d06ec988f2ca9f9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d096f1d06ec988f2ca9f9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>许久未见的好友特辑！本集嘉宾是银桥碉堡酒馆的老板小封，同时也是一位吉他老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和小封熟悉起来是今年春天阿达吆市集上和他玩节奏沙球。后来他偶尔会分享一些好听的歌给小璐，心想我自己听肯定不过瘾，干脆邀请来给大家分享歌！</span></p><span></span><p><span>小封听歌范围广泛，尤其偏爱爵士。再次打开新世界的大门🔛</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制节目的时候我和云峰都明显感受到：他是真的爱听歌啊！专注又愉悦。节目结尾还有一小段小封的创作~</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听！如果你也有想分享的音乐欢迎评论区留言👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Arabian Night - Karim Azedia</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 嘉宾介绍：小封是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> Water (Live) - Lauryn Hill</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> ミスター・ピアノマン - 上田正樹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> No Problem - Mads Vinding/Duke Jordan&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> Bonzo's Montreux - Led Zeppelin</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> El penultimo - Ástor Pantaleón Piazzolla</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> Temptation - Tom Waits</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> Todo Cambia - Mercedes Sosa</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3385">56:25</a> 彩蛋：小封的创作 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 网易云歌单直达：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12525000508&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12525000508&amp;userid=51289958"><span>碉堡酒馆</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-----------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小璐、云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小封</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
