  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 还有人记得Airbnb吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66aa60b933ddcbb53c7624b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66aa60b933ddcbb53c7624b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 16:05:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近常常想起小璐之前供职的这家公司，无论是因为Airbnb退出中国2周年了，更是因为大理特别像一个“巨大的Airbnb”：亲切的朋友、共居的方式、共享的理念……</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这算是一期怀旧节目，我们选择了一些影响过我们的影视剧OST，边听歌边聊天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，虽然Airbnb退出中国了，但我和云峰依然在用类似的方式生活。我们的院子都开放部分房间招募室友，听了这集节目想认识我们的朋友可以在小红书🍠找到我们。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60ac6c160000000001007219" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60ac6c160000000001007219"><span>云峰敏君的家（三文笔村）</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftyzqzn2qzckT00o67CLRiXxgV_D.png"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56e5299d84edcd7896aa87a9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56e5299d84edcd7896aa87a9"><span>小璐的家（银桥鹤阳村）</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpppqIatulhSUo8SKhhROIMZ92-D.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 为什么会有这个选题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> Airbnb余韵犹存：大理苍山徒步之家 &amp; OTC小镇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 大理很多人的生活方式非常像Airbnb</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 云峰的院子准备了一年后决定开放招募室友了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 这集节目的内容如下：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 影响过我们的”大家住在一起“的影视剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 和室友相处的感受or期待</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 大理旅居有哪些选择和大理租房小贴士</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🏡 🏡 🏡</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12303893072&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=12303893072&amp;userid=51289958"><span>🎵本期歌单：</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>老伙记 - 侧田/Eric Kwok</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gymnopedies 1 - Erik Satie</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sky Blue and Black - Jackson Browne</span></p><span></span><p><span>Happy Together - The Turtles</span></p><span></span><p><span>걱정말아요 그대 - 野菊花</span></p><span></span><p><span>Trouble With Boys - Loreta</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅途 - 老狼</span></p><span></span><p><span>Top Of The World - Carpenters</span></p><span></span><p><span>Into Your Arms - The Lemonheads</span></p><span></span><p><span>Have You Ever Really Loved A Woman? - Bryan Adams</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆圈 - 树子</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏡 🏡 🏡</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小璐、云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljCcQz-iXUi4YgfIsbH3hHrL04li.m4a" length="53734990" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhujaYzqjfYf6Mw3eovNTM-mdQ1k.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
