  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 百试百灵的召唤晴天歌单 ☀️ 雨季不用愁，晴女来帮忙！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665d92aa94977a26efe23176</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665d92aa94977a26efe23176</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>迷信大概是人类本能的趣味，更何况我们生活在遍布神婆癫公的大理。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年的求雨歌单灵验之后，雨就下个不停……</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和云峰一直说要录召唤晴天的“晴女”歌单，拖了一年终于实现了：</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次说“要不咱6月录召唤晴天的歌单？”，第二天就 </span><strong><span>放晴了</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来素材收集完，我约云峰说“要不下周录制？”，第二天 </span><strong><span>又放晴了</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制前一天还在下雨，我和云峰确认“明天录吗？”，结果录制当天 </span><strong><span>晴空万里</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>就说灵不灵验！朋友们！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以上可能纯属机缘巧合和我生拉硬靠的所谓“灵验时刻”，迷信这事，开心就好:）</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉🏻 附上：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64884d9053a5e5ea1494e2ee" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64884d9053a5e5ea1494e2ee"><span>Vol.6 亲测灵验的求雨歌单</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>“这雨可快停吧！”每当大理雨季到来，我内心就时不时发出这样的哀嚎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这集歌单送给同样即将迎来“全面降雨”的你们~</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制的时候很开心，似乎对雨季的恐惧也消解了一些。下雨也好晴天也罢，每一种天气都有不同的烦恼和快乐，感受最重要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 为什么想录制召唤晴天的歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 小璐的雨季恐怖回忆：蛇鼠一窝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 云峰的雨季记忆：电动车被水冲走，辛酸又搞笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 雨季到来的标志就是：睡觉时雨水直接打在脸上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 老房子屋顶的“漏雨恐惧症”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 大理的彩虹&amp;双彩虹🌈也太多了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> 云峰和朋友们去木香坪徒步的美好回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 美好回忆都在路上：雨季结束去溯溪啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3275">54:35</a> 和朋友在一起，即便不靠谱，也是幸福的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">60:16</a> 下雨天适合干嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌧️🌦️☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期歌单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10034020505&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10034020505&amp;userid=51289958"><span>这雨可快停吧</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Vibe - Walk off the Earth</span></p><span></span><p><span>Another Sunny Day - Belle &amp; Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>未知 - 窦唯</span></p><span></span><p><span>HAVE A NICE DAY - 魏如萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>A Day When The Sun Died - December</span></p><span></span><p><span>Do Not Be Afraid - 何大河</span></p><span></span><p><span>光阴向太阳(Feat. Yehaiyahan) - Howie Lee/YEHAIYAHAN</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏夜晴朗的晚上 - Matt吕彦良</span></p><span></span><p><span>That Day,We Saw The Sunset Near The Sea - α·Pav</span></p><span></span><p><span>Blue Skies - Lana Del Rey</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌧️🌦️☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小璐、云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：云峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小璐</span></p>]]></description>
