  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 亲测大理美食必吃榜Top10 &amp; 听起来“很好吃”的歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662fbbf94858131450567fb1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662fbbf94858131450567fb1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 15:25:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是嘉宾敏君返场的节目👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我们要聊聊「</span><strong><span>吃</span></strong><span>」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>敏君是小璐心目中的“大理米其林”，每当有朋友来大理不知道吃什么就会问问她。她也确实身体力行地在大理生活的4年中，吃遍了各种风格各种类型的餐厅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目推荐了近期敏君 </span><strong><span>最推荐的大理餐厅Top10</span></strong><span>，亲测不踩雷，千万不要错过！无论是来大理短期玩耍、旅居，还是长期生活在这里的新大理人，都建议收听~ 期待你们在评论区的反馈😆</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，作为一档音乐分享类节目，小璐和云峰分享了10首歌：小璐分享的歌侧重文字表达，云峰分享的歌侧重情绪感受。🎵网易云歌单→ </span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=8408013770&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=8408013770&amp;userid=51289958"><span>好吃的歌</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们每聊完一家餐厅和推荐的食物，就会播放一首歌曲。你可以在听歌的间隙，切换到其他app收藏感兴趣的餐厅~</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之，这是一集会流口水的“很好吃”也很好听的节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> Top10：阿米乃·这家好吃呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 云峰的歌：Stereolab; Nurse with Wound - Simple Headphone Mind</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> &nbsp;Top9：饮相聚涮饵丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 小璐的歌：企鹅熊爱吃鸡肉球 - 时速三百英哩的余灰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> &nbsp;Top8：至尊宝卤味螺蛳粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> &nbsp;云峰的歌：刺猬 - 2014 色彩漫游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> &nbsp;Top7：瑞丰园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> &nbsp;小璐的歌：林生祥 - Edamame 毛豆之歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> &nbsp;Top6：鄂味小龙虾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> &nbsp;云峰的歌：逃跑计划 - 闪光的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> &nbsp;Top5：赵一刀铜瓢牛肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> &nbsp;小璐的歌：窦唯; 译乐队 - 象忆之味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> &nbsp;Top4：三山下夺夺粉火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3139">52:19</a> &nbsp;云峰的歌：The Cure - Lovesong</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> &nbsp;Top3：小院肥肠鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3494">58:14</a> &nbsp;小璐的歌：never young beach - 気持ちいい風が吹いたんです</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> &nbsp;Top2：玖道门院子老火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">62:40</a> &nbsp;云峰的歌：Men I Trust - Billie Toppy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3899">64:59</a> &nbsp;Top1：石弋朝鲜族美食屋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4244">70:44</a> &nbsp;小璐的歌：浪味仙贝 - 冬天想吃冰淇凌</span></p>]]></description>
