    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期世界读书日的特别番外节目，小璐在书店经常播放的背景音乐歌单中，选择了15首适合读书时听的歌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前几分钟是对这些音乐的简单介绍，后面是无间断播放。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你能在这期节目中找到适合自己读书时听的歌，希望你多多感受阅读和音乐的美好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不想听絮叨想直接进入沉浸式歌单的朋友可以直接点击对应时间进入↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 本期节目歌单简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 谢玉岗 - 新年&nbsp;New&nbsp;Year&nbsp;Day</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> Nils Frahm; Ólafur Arnalds - b1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> Nils Frahm - No-w-here&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> Ólafur Arnalds - This Place Is a Shelter &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 纳兰慧心 - 舒曼：异国和异国的人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> ホテルニュートーキョー - プレイガール</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> Kings of Convenience - Ask For Help</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> Novo Amor - Carry You</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> 窦唯; 朝简 - 冬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3495">58:15</a> Mogwai - I Know You Are but What Am I</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">63:34</a> Sigur Rós - Svefn-g-englar</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4371">72:51</a> U-zhaan; 坂本龍一 - energy flow - rework</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4750">79:10</a> 細野晴臣 - TALKING あなたについてのおしゃべりあれこれ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5642">94:02</a> 高橋幸宏 - WHERE ARE YOU HEADING TO</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5893">98:13</a> イエロー・マジック・オーケストラ - イエロー・マジック(东风)</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚「小路书屋」日常背景音乐：🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=7752278122&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=7752278122&amp;userid=51289958"><span>网易云歌单 </span></a><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
