  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 用九首歌感受春天瞬间，以及始于春天和止于春天的情感故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd2a8e2d9eae5d0a5c9298</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd2a8e2d9eae5d0a5c9298</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 06:51:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和好朋友聊天就是欢畅淋漓！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是我们经常在节目中念叨的敏君~</span></p><span></span><p><span>小璐、云峰和嘉宾敏君一起分享了</span></p><span></span><p><span>感受到春天的迹象，</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年春天各自的变化，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及始于春天和止于春天的情感故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>万万没想到这是一期又笑又哭的节目，</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对熟悉信任的好友，</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多情绪在聊天中沸腾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>非常难忘的录制体验，</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望明年同一时间我们再来录制一期~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 欢迎敏君👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 一年一度《米店》月，我们听听其他歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> </span><strong><span>春天的迹象</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>云峰：盖被子觉得热了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 《春よ、来い/春天快来》- 中西保志</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小璐：太阳晒不住了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 《Another Sunny Day》- Belle &amp; Sebastian</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>敏君：风变热了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 《微风细雨》- 邓丽君</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> </span><strong><span>春天的变化</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小璐：骑摩托</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 《春风吻上我的脸》- 姚莉</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>敏君：辞职</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 《静止》- 花儿乐队</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>云峰：变中二</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 《春来了》- 南无乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> </span><strong><span>春天的爱情</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 云峰敏君迎来了爱情故事的第5年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 小璐提问：彼此身上持续吸引的闪光点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 小璐提问：默契大考验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 《虎口脱险》- 老狼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 小璐提问：求同存异，“同”的部分是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 没有开始的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">68:10</a> 《被动》- 伍佰</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本集歌单：网易云 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=9504571302&amp;userid=51289958" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=9504571302&amp;userid=51289958"><span>春天瞬间</span></a></p>]]></description>
